    "long_instructions": "## Compare Data Completeness\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n1. Look through the `stops` array.\r\n2. Compare how much information each stop has.\r\n3. Focus on the `notes` field across stops.\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n\r\n- Which stops have more detailed information?\r\n- Which have less or missing information?\r\n- Which stop would seem more important or useful? Why?",
